OL,3,CFurther arrests after cargo ship
OL,4,Cworkers attacked in suspected hate
OL,5,Ccrime
OL,7,FTwo further arrests have been made
OL,8,Fafter three Filipino cargo ship
OL,9,Fworkers were injured in a suspected
OL,10,Fhate crime near Bristol.
OL,12,FOfficers were called to Richmond
OL,13,FTerrace in Avonmouth at around 8.30pm
OL,14,Fon Friday 31 July, following reports
OL,15,Fof an altercation involving a number
OL,16,Fof people.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
