OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786960091
OL,3,CFurther arrests after cargo ship
OL,4,Cworkers attacked in suspected hate
OL,5,Ccrime
OL,7,FOne of the men was discharged from
OL,8,Fhospital after receiving medical care,
OL,9,Fhowever the other remains in a
OL,10,Fcritical condition in hospital. A
OL,11,Fthird man suffered minor injuries.
OL,13,FAn 18-year-old man was arrested on
OL,14,Fsuspicion of attempted murder
OL,15,Fyesterday (13 August). He has been
OL,16,Freleased on conditional bail.
OL,18,FEarlier today (14 August), a 28-year-
OL,19,Fold man was arrested on suspicion of
OL,20,Fattempted murder and he has also been
OL,21,Freleased on conditional bail.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
