OL,3,CFurther arrests after cargo ship
OL,4,Cworkers attacked in suspected hate
OL,5,Ccrime
OL,7,FKurtis Ranklin, 45 and from Southmead,
OL,8,Fhas been charged with causing grievous
OL,9,Fbodily harm with intent. Police said
OL,10,Fthis is in relation to the injuries
OL,11,Fsustained by the man who remains in
OL,12,Fhospital.
OL,14,FA 17-year-old male has been charged
OL,15,Fwith wounding with intent to cause
OL,16,Fgrievous bodily harm in relation to
OL,17,Fthe man who has been discharged from
OL,18,Fhospital. He cannot be named as he is
OL,19,Fnot an adult.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
