PN,40304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786960091
OL,3,CFurther arrests after cargo ship
OL,4,Cworkers attacked in suspected hate
OL,5,Ccrime
OL,7,FRanklin and the 17-year-old male will
OL,8,Fappear at Bristol Crown Court in
OL,9,FSeptember.
OL,11,FThis now brings the total arrested to
OL,12,Fsix, with a 19-year-old man arrested
OL,13,Fon suspicion of attempted murder on 31
OL,14,FJuly, and a 38-year-old woman arrested
OL,15,Fon suspicion of assisting an offender
OL,16,Fthe following day. They are both on
OL,17,Fconditional bail.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
