OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786960091
OL,3,CFurther arrests after cargo ship
OL,4,Cworkers attacked in suspected hate
OL,5,Ccrime
OL,7,FAvon and Somerset Police said all
OL,8,Fthree of the victims were staff
OL,9,Fmembers from a cargo ship that
OL,10,Frecently docked at Avonmouth and all
OL,11,Fwere Filipino nationals.
OL,13,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,18,FOfficers have confirmed the incident
OL,19,Fis being treated as a suspected hate
OL,20,Fcrime, after reports of racist
OL,21,Flanguage being used during the attack.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
