CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786960091
OL,3,CFurther arrests after cargo ship
OL,4,Cworkers attacked in suspected hate
OL,5,Ccrime
OL,7,FIn a statement, Acting Detective
OL,8,FInspector Kate Bettel, of the Major
OL,9,FCrime Investigation Team, said: "Six
OL,10,Farrests have been made as part of our
OL,11,Fenquiries, and that has led to two of
OL,12,Fthose people being charged and
OL,13,Fappearing in court.
OL,15,F"We know this incident has left people
OL,16,Fin the area shocked and we wish to
OL,17,Freassure them that our investigation
OL,18,Fis progressing. We will continue to
OL,19,Fprovide key updates to make sure the
OL,20,Fpublic remain informed throughout the
OL,21,Fcourse of our enquiries.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786960091
OL,3,CFurther arrests after cargo ship
OL,4,Cworkers attacked in suspected hate
OL,5,Ccrime
OL,7,F"At the centre of this investigation
OL,8,Fthere is a man who remains critically
OL,9,Fill in hospital, and we are doing all
OL,10,Fwe can to provide his family with as
OL,11,Fmuch information as we can about what
OL,12,Fhappened.
OL,14,F"Given the seriousness of the injuries
OL,15,Fsustained, the support of the
OL,16,Fcommunity to our investigation
OL,17,Fcontinues to be invaluable and we
OL,18,Fwould continue to ask anyone with
OL,19,Finformation to come forward, either
OL,20,Fdirectly to us or anonymously to
OL,21,FCrimestoppers."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
